{
  "refresh": "1m",
  "uid": "site-greenhouse-equipment",
  "title": "Site: Greenhouse \u2014 Equipment",
  "description": "Equipment runtime and cycles are observed relay evidence. Wet-relay runtime is never delivered gallons; runtime-modeled energy uses the provenance-bearing canonical coefficient catalog and remains separate from partial Shelly measurement.",
